OL,3,A'Everybody was as one': Rector reflects
OL,4,Aon search effort for Noah Woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe love shown by a community who
OL,7,Frallied to search for missing
OL,8,Fthree-year-old Noah Woods was a "thread
OL,9,Fof positivity" amongst the tragedy, a
OL,10,Frector has said.
OL,12,FNoah disappeared from a playground in
OL,13,FBrantham, Suffolk, at about 15:00 BST
OL,14,Fon Tuesday after becoming separated
OL,15,Ffrom a relative.
OL,17,FAt least 1,300 people helped to try to
OL,18,Ffind him in the following 24 hours,
OL,19,Fbefore a child's body was discovered on
OL,20,FWednesday afternoon at a nearby pond.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
