OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Everybody was as one': Rector reflects
OL,4,Aon search effort for Noah Woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reverend Chris Willis said:
OL,7,F"Everybody was as one... what we saw
OL,8,Fthroughout was a real coming together
OL,9,Fof people and a willingness to work
OL,10,Ftogether which, in spite of the deep
OL,11,Fsadness, was a thread of real
OL,12,Fpositivity seeing how people cared."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
