OL,3,ANinth woman's body found as South
OL,4,AAfrican police investigate string of
OL,5,Adeaths
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe discovery follows the deaths of
OL,8,Feight other women whose bodies have
OL,9,Fbeen found since July across
OL,10,FEkurhuleni, a major urban area of
OL,11,FJohannesburg.
OL,13,FSeveral of the women were found
OL,14,Fpartially clothed and with injuries,
OL,15,Fbut police have stressed that they have
OL,16,Fnot established whether all the deaths
OL,17,Fare connected or whether a serial
OL,18,Fkiller is responsible.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
